    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's been two weeks since the funeral. the house is so quiet it actually hurts my ears. i keep walking into his room to check on him or get something, and then i remember. i don't even know what to do with my hands anymore. i feel like i just... disappeared. like there's nothing left of me.",
